hints.pseudocode:
best = infinity
for each start node s:
  dist = -1 everywhere; parent = -1; dist[s] = 0; queue = [s]
  while queue: u = pop front
    for v in neighbours of u:
      if dist[v] == -1: dist[v] = dist[u] + 1; parent[v] = u; push v
      elif parent[u] != v: best = min(best, dist[u] + dist[v] + 1)
return best, or -1 if it was never set
